00:03:51.981 --> 00:03:53.811
Punching machine!

00:03:59.691 --> 00:04:00.991
I'm going home…

00:04:00.991 --> 00:04:05.491
THE ULTIMATE MENTOR

00:04:09.991 --> 00:04:12.331
Finally done with all the tests.

00:04:12.791 --> 00:04:15.041
Now to wait for the results.

00:04:16.751 --> 00:04:18.961
Oh, you're done, too?

00:04:19.461 --> 00:04:20.091
Yes.

00:04:20.841 --> 00:04:24.051
Hey, is there any point in you taking fitness tests?

00:04:24.051 --> 00:04:24.841
Huh?

00:04:24.841 --> 00:04:28.931
I mean, can't you just give them your specs?

00:04:29.851 --> 00:04:31.141
Well, whatever.

00:04:31.141 --> 00:04:32.931
So, how was it?

00:04:32.931 --> 00:04:36.851
Both the written and fitness tests
were far too simple.

00:04:37.311 --> 00:04:38.611
Right?

00:04:38.611 --> 00:04:41.361
Is that really all there is to becoming a hero?

00:04:41.981 --> 00:04:44.241
We should get our results soon.

00:04:44.241 --> 00:04:46.611
70 points is a passing grade.

00:04:46.611 --> 00:04:51.081
The written test was so easy
anyone could get full points on it.

00:04:51.081 --> 00:04:53.371
That just leaves the fitness test,

00:04:53.371 --> 00:04:55.541
which should have been a walk in the park for us.

00:04:55.541 --> 00:04:58.631
One Hour Later

