The above-named

00:05:17.771 --> 00:05:22.281
has been classified as an

00:05:18.601 --> 00:05:21.021
Oh! This means I'm…

00:05:21.021 --> 00:05:22.281
Class S.

00:05:22.281 --> 00:05:23.861
I am not surprised.

00:05:24.941 --> 00:05:27.951
On top of that, the font size is bigger than mine.

00:05:29.451 --> 00:05:30.911
I expected nothing less, Master.

00:05:31.581 --> 00:05:34.041
By the way, what did they ask you at the interview?

00:05:34.701 --> 00:05:35.911
Interview?

00:05:35.911 --> 00:05:36.541
Yes.

00:05:37.791 --> 00:05:40.041
Just one final question.

00:05:40.881 --> 00:05:41.791
Genos,

00:05:42.711 --> 00:05:44.801
does this building look familiar to you?

00:05:45.671 --> 00:05:49.801
We were secretly investigating a group of troublemakers

00:05:49.801 --> 00:05:52.761
that called themselves the House of Evolution.

00:05:52.761 --> 00:05:55.521
Just when we'd identified
their base of operations,

00:05:55.521 --> 00:05:59.231
we found the building had been
mysteriously destroyed.

00:06:00.271 --> 00:06:02.941
And with overwhelming firepower.

00:06:05.611 --> 00:06:09.201
Are you responsible for this?

00:06:09.201 --> 00:06:10.701
I am.

00:06:10.701 --> 00:06:11.201
Why?

00:06:14.451 --> 00:06:19.541
Can self-destruct if necessary

00:06:14.451 --> 00:06:19.541
<Reason For Application> To be accepted as an apprentice

00:06:14.451 --> 00:06:19.541
I'll use any meats at my disposal to eradicate evil in the name of justice

00:06:14.451 --> 00:06:19.541
<Skill> Incineration

00:06:20.421 --> 00:06:21.921
I see…

00:06:21.921 --> 00:06:26.671
I suppose they must have felt no need to
go through the trouble of interviewing you.

00:06:28.671 --> 00:06:29.681
Master?

00:06:31.841 --> 00:06:33.551
Yeah, after all…

00:06:33.551 --> 00:06:37.561
I'm just a C-class hero who only scored 71 points.

