Hero Association

00:06:39.021 --> 00:06:39.731
I see.

00:06:40.941 --> 00:06:45.571
So I mistook the top half of
the "C" for belonging to an "S."

00:06:45.571 --> 00:06:46.981
Don't analyze it!

00:06:47.281 --> 00:06:48.821
It must be a mistake.

00:06:49.361 --> 00:06:51.411
I will talk to the person in charge.

00:06:51.411 --> 00:06:53.571
No, don't! You'll just embarrass me!

00:06:55.081 --> 00:06:57.451
Paging Mr. Genos and Mr. Saitama.

00:06:57.451 --> 00:07:00.711
There will be a seminar for
successful candidates at 4 PM.

00:07:00.711 --> 00:07:02.421
Please come to lecture hall #3.

00:07:03.331 --> 00:07:05.171
All right, let's go.

00:07:05.171 --> 00:07:08.921
All that really matters is that we passed.

00:07:08.921 --> 00:07:10.721
Let's get this over with and go home.

00:07:13.391 --> 00:07:16.511
We finally found the cyborg we've been looking for.

00:07:16.511 --> 00:07:18.181
So I've heard.

00:07:18.721 --> 00:07:20.771
In light of his past accomplishments,

00:07:20.771 --> 00:07:23.981
we made an exception and
certified him as an S-class hero.

00:07:24.651 --> 00:07:28.531
I just wanted to make sure you were notified of this.

00:07:28.531 --> 00:07:31.201
Yes, I approve.

00:07:37.121 --> 00:07:38.411
Genos, huh?

00:07:39.251 --> 00:07:41.251
LECTURE HALL #3

00:07:42.041 --> 00:07:44.001
First, congratulations on passing.

00:07:47.841 --> 00:07:50.881
Now, one of you only made it on a fluke,

00:07:50.881 --> 00:07:52.761
so unless you want your luck to go to waste,

00:07:53.181 --> 00:07:55.471
I better see you giving it your all.

00:07:56.801 --> 00:07:58.761
And don't get full of yourself!

00:07:58.761 --> 00:08:03.271
From here on, keep your hero status
in mind and act modestly!

00:08:04.021 --> 00:08:09.191
After all, your faces will be placed on the Hero Association's website.

00:08:11.491 --> 00:08:13.401
Did you hear me?

00:08:13.401 --> 00:08:16.991
That goofball head of yours is
gonna be shown to the whole world.

00:08:16.991 --> 00:08:18.531
If you don't want to humiliate yourselves…

00:08:25.291 --> 00:08:27.921
Aspire to be a fine hero like me!

00:08:32.841 --> 00:08:33.801
Master!

00:08:36.431 --> 00:08:40.641
As an A-class hero, I have some influence over the Association.

00:08:40.641 --> 00:08:42.721
I'll make sure those who behave irresponsibly…

00:08:42.721 --> 00:08:45.101
lose points and get demoted!

00:08:45.101 --> 00:08:46.231
Don't you forget it!

00:08:47.811 --> 00:08:49.771
What should I have for dinner?

00:08:52.191 --> 00:08:56.241
Apparently, the Hero Association
was formed about three years ago.

00:08:57.991 --> 00:09:00.031
So it's only been around for three years?

00:09:00.031 --> 00:09:04.001
It was after the grandchild of a millionaire called Agoni was attacked by a monster.

00:09:04.001 --> 00:09:06.961
The child was saved by a passerby.

00:09:06.961 --> 00:09:09.041
When Agoni heard what had happened,

00:09:09.041 --> 00:09:14.511
he came up with this system and used his fortune
to establish the Hero Association.

00:09:14.511 --> 00:09:17.681
Well, they put on some pretty boring seminars.

00:09:17.681 --> 00:09:24.061
In any case, as new heroes,
we'll be known around the world.

00:09:24.061 --> 00:09:26.891
Now we can work with our heads held high.

00:09:29.311 --> 00:09:30.151
Master.

00:09:33.691 --> 00:09:35.651
I guess I'm officially your apprentice now.

00:09:37.661 --> 00:09:41.161
Please continue to guide me as my mentor.

00:09:41.161 --> 00:09:42.281
Sure…

00:09:42.281 --> 00:09:44.501
All right, Master. Farewell.

00:09:44.501 --> 00:09:46.791
Y-Yeah, see you.

00:09:50.001 --> 00:09:51.341
Crap…

00:09:51.341 --> 00:09:54.421
Maybe I shouldn't have been
so quick to take on an apprentice.

00:09:56.341 --> 00:09:58.181
Especially this guy…

00:09:58.181 --> 00:10:02.431
Office

00:09:58.181 --> 00:10:02.431
Did those two newcomers really pass the exam?

00:10:02.431 --> 00:10:04.521
Their attitudes were awful!

00:10:04.521 --> 00:10:09.941
I'm rank 38 in Class A, dammit,
and they had no idea who I was.

00:10:09.941 --> 00:10:12.571
Plus they don't know the first thing
about how the world works.

00:10:12.571 --> 00:10:14.071
Damn amateurs!

00:10:14.361 --> 00:10:16.151
They'll be dirt-napping in no time.

00:10:16.151 --> 00:10:16.901
No.

00:10:18.281 --> 00:10:21.871
Genos got perfect scores on both the written and physical exams.

00:10:21.871 --> 00:10:25.741
He's a phenomenal rookie who was granted S-class status right off the bat.

00:10:25.741 --> 00:10:30.291
The other one, Saitama,
had terrible scores on the essay,

00:10:30.291 --> 00:10:32.841
but scored a perfect 50 on the physical portion.

00:10:32.841 --> 00:10:35.271
That's the only reason he passed at all.

00:10:36.011 --> 00:10:38.511
And in practically every activity on the fitness exam,

00:10:38.881 --> 00:10:43.511
he broke the Hero Association's
test records by inconceivable margins.

00:10:46.311 --> 00:10:49.851
It's as if there's a god residing in that body.

00:10:52.231 --> 00:10:57.151
Snek, you've already been outranked by Genos,

00:10:57.151 --> 00:11:00.701
and Saitama may catch up with you soon enough.

00:11:03.621 --> 00:11:06.041
That jackass?

00:11:06.871 --> 00:11:11.671
If I get to the top of Class C,
then I'll get promoted to Class B.

00:11:11.671 --> 00:11:16.591
Class A is above that,
and Class S is right at the top.

00:11:17.881 --> 00:11:20.671
I guess Genos is actually pretty amazing.

00:11:24.011 --> 00:11:25.431
I dunno.

00:11:26.181 --> 00:11:29.021
Maybe this isn't the kind of hero I wanted to be.

00:11:32.561 --> 00:11:35.611
The induction seminar isn't over yet!

00:11:35.611 --> 00:11:38.901
Hazing rookies is common in this line of business.

00:11:39.281 --> 00:11:42.661
A lot of us heroes hate to be outranked.

00:11:43.111 --> 00:11:47.201
So we take care of newbies early on… like this!

00:12:23.151 --> 00:12:24.411
Hero Registry?

00:12:24.951 --> 00:12:26.071
Yes.

00:12:26.071 --> 00:12:29.991
I am an S-class hero, and you are a C-class hero.

00:12:29.991 --> 00:12:31.951
We are both ranked last in our classes.

00:12:32.451 --> 00:12:36.921
Right now, we are still listed as Genos and Saitama,

00:12:36.921 --> 00:12:40.131
but as we perform more heroic acts,
we will acquire hero names.

00:12:40.801 --> 00:12:43.381
Hero names? What are those?

00:12:43.381 --> 00:12:49.011
I believe they are like nicknames
that capture a hero's characteristics.

00:12:49.011 --> 00:12:51.471
For example, I might be the "Blond Cyborg."

00:12:51.771 --> 00:12:56.101
Wait, if that's how it works,
won't I be the "Caped Baldy"?

00:12:57.311 --> 00:12:59.061
Aside from being ranked by ability,

00:12:59.061 --> 00:13:01.821
you can also be ranked by popularity.

00:13:01.821 --> 00:13:03.741
Some heroes have fan clubs.

00:13:04.701 --> 00:13:07.031
Well, no one cares about that.

00:13:07.031 --> 00:13:07.361
Wha—?!

00:13:08.281 --> 00:13:12.621
Thank you for agreeing to my unreasonable request today.

00:13:13.001 --> 00:13:17.171
Well, I did promise to make you my apprentice.

00:13:18.001 --> 00:13:19.671
Is right here good?

00:13:19.671 --> 00:13:20.381
Yes.

00:13:21.341 --> 00:13:23.091
So we're just sparring, right?

00:13:23.091 --> 00:13:24.631
Not fighting for real?

00:13:24.971 --> 00:13:26.381
Yes, that's what I have in mind.

00:13:27.131 --> 00:13:29.391
But I want you to go all out,

00:13:30.141 --> 00:13:32.181
so I too will give it my all.

00:13:38.731 --> 00:13:39.941
Please grant my request.

00:14:16.181 --> 00:14:17.351
That was close…

00:14:17.351 --> 00:14:19.651
My clothes almost got burnt again.

00:14:25.861 --> 00:14:27.151
I need more speed!

00:14:51.051 --> 00:14:51.591
He's gone?

00:14:52.341 --> 00:14:55.221
Have I been chasing his afterimage this whole time?

00:15:01.151 --> 00:15:01.731
There!

00:15:08.901 --> 00:15:10.111
Incinerate!

00:15:12.611 --> 00:15:14.371
I got him this time.

00:15:14.371 --> 00:15:16.411
Master will have to take me more seriously now…

00:15:17.041 --> 00:15:17.831
Behind—

00:15:18.871 --> 00:15:20.041
Okay, I win.

00:15:25.291 --> 00:15:26.381
Master…

00:15:26.381 --> 00:15:26.711
Yeah?

00:15:27.501 --> 00:15:29.971
Have you forgotten the rules of this match?

00:15:30.921 --> 00:15:34.551
Dodge any attack you are able to dodge.

00:15:34.551 --> 00:15:36.101
Take it seriously. No fooling around.

00:15:36.971 --> 00:15:39.141
Do not hold back.

00:15:39.141 --> 00:15:39.641
Also…

00:15:41.021 --> 00:15:44.061
Keep fighting until I am no longer able to fight.

00:15:45.521 --> 00:15:47.691
Even my master himself cannot explain

00:15:48.191 --> 00:15:50.941
the secret to his power.

00:15:51.901 --> 00:15:54.201
This fight may give me some insight into it.

00:15:55.781 --> 00:15:57.331
Show me no mercy.

00:16:02.411 --> 00:16:04.121
Those were the rules, Master—

00:16:08.171 --> 00:16:09.091
What the—?!

00:16:09.131 --> 00:16:10.591
DEATH

00:16:22.771 --> 00:16:25.521
I'm starving. Let's grab a bite.

00:16:25.521 --> 00:16:26.981
How does udon sound?

00:16:30.321 --> 00:16:31.491
Okay…

00:16:34.201 --> 00:16:38.161
I am prepared to do anything in order to become stronger.

00:16:38.911 --> 00:16:39.601
But…

00:16:40.871 --> 00:16:44.001
I can't picture myself ever
approaching Master's power.

00:16:45.961 --> 00:16:47.501
Not in a million years.

00:16:52.511 --> 00:16:54.131
He's on another level.

00:16:56.261 --> 00:16:57.431
What's the matter?

00:16:57.431 --> 00:16:58.801
You don't like udon?

00:17:02.601 --> 00:17:05.141
I see, so that's where he is.

00:17:05.731 --> 00:17:07.311
Thanks, I'll head there now.

00:17:08.521 --> 00:17:11.071
No, don't worry.

00:17:11.071 --> 00:17:14.111
I'm just going to let him know
what the industry expects of him.

00:17:16.701 --> 00:17:18.621
I'm glad you like udon.

00:17:19.161 --> 00:17:21.791
Yes, I'm not very picky.

00:17:22.161 --> 00:17:25.461
Well, I'm also kinda low on funds right now…

00:17:26.791 --> 00:17:28.961
Hey, how about another match, Genos?

00:17:30.171 --> 00:17:34.841
Super-Spicy

00:17:30.171 --> 00:17:34.841
Mega-Monster

00:17:30.171 --> 00:17:34.841
PRIZE

00:17:30.171 --> 00:17:34.841
PENALTY

00:17:35.511 --> 00:17:36.881
That's insane!

00:17:36.881 --> 00:17:38.221
No way!

00:17:42.351 --> 00:17:43.141
I give up…

00:17:49.101 --> 00:17:50.111
Is that it?

00:17:52.441 --> 00:17:54.191
Man, you're awesome!

00:17:56.491 --> 00:17:57.701
Welcome—

00:18:02.781 --> 00:18:04.161
You must be Genos.

00:18:06.001 --> 00:18:08.121
I'm rank 1 in Class A, Amai Mask.

00:18:08.711 --> 00:18:10.081
I'd like to talk to you.

00:18:10.791 --> 00:18:12.461
Class A, rank 1?

00:18:12.791 --> 00:18:13.961
It's Amai Mask!

00:18:13.961 --> 00:18:15.961
He's so gorgeous!

00:18:16.671 --> 00:18:17.721
Talk?

00:18:18.341 --> 00:18:20.681
He might be here to haze you…

00:18:20.681 --> 00:18:22.011
Be careful, Genos!

00:18:22.641 --> 00:18:23.971
I see.

00:18:23.971 --> 00:18:25.891
Please wait here, Master.

00:18:27.021 --> 00:18:28.271
Very well.

00:18:28.271 --> 00:18:31.101
I was just thinking about
taking a walk to digest my food.

00:18:36.781 --> 00:18:39.361
I hear an exception was made
to grant you S-class status.

00:18:39.361 --> 00:18:40.861
What of it?

00:18:47.291 --> 00:18:49.161
I wonder if he's all right.

00:18:58.051 --> 00:19:00.681
Done already?

00:19:00.681 --> 00:19:01.511
Yes.

00:19:01.511 --> 00:19:03.551
You really are Class S material.

00:19:03.551 --> 00:19:07.141
To have the top-ranked A-class hero
come to haze you personally…

00:19:07.141 --> 00:19:07.771
That's not it.

00:19:09.061 --> 00:19:12.901
So he wasn't here to fight?
Then what gives?

00:19:12.901 --> 00:19:14.441
In short…

00:19:15.271 --> 00:19:16.981
He came to welcome me.

00:19:17.321 --> 00:19:20.111
Huh? What's that mean?

00:19:20.111 --> 00:19:21.491
E-Excuse me!

00:19:22.071 --> 00:19:24.911
You're friends with Amai Mask, right?

00:19:24.911 --> 00:19:25.991
May I shake your hand?

00:19:29.621 --> 00:19:30.661
Thank you very much!

00:19:30.661 --> 00:19:32.171
Shake mine too!

00:19:36.961 --> 00:19:41.131
S-class and C-class heroes
sure get treated differently.

00:19:41.631 --> 00:19:44.391
If you think about it, though, isn't that like fraud money?

00:19:44.391 --> 00:19:47.391
Welcome Gift

00:19:44.761 --> 00:19:46.301
I mean, you're a cyborg, right?

00:19:46.931 --> 00:19:47.391
Yes…

00:19:48.061 --> 00:19:49.391
Never mind.

00:19:49.391 --> 00:19:52.391
In any case, now we're even with a win and a loss apiece.

00:19:52.941 --> 00:19:56.311
Starting today, we're professional heroes.

00:19:56.311 --> 00:19:58.281
Let's do our best, okay?

00:19:58.651 --> 00:19:59.321
Yes.

00:20:01.991 --> 00:20:07.281
A professional hero must always be a beautiful symbol of justice.

00:20:08.201 --> 00:20:10.621
That is my philosophy.

00:20:10.621 --> 00:20:12.411
It's especially true if you're an S-class hero.

00:20:14.331 --> 00:20:17.091
Come on. There's no need to glare at me.

00:20:17.671 --> 00:20:20.551
I came all the way here just to see you.

00:20:21.421 --> 00:20:23.341
How was the Certification Exam?

00:20:23.341 --> 00:20:26.681
It was a load of rubbish.
An exam like that is a waste of time.

00:20:29.431 --> 00:20:31.851
If you came to fight, get on with it.

00:20:31.851 --> 00:20:33.271
This, too, is a waste of time.

00:20:36.311 --> 00:20:38.441
Being hot-blooded is fine,

00:20:39.021 --> 00:20:40.191
but if you take it too far…

00:20:41.611 --> 00:20:42.781
you'll get burnt.

00:20:46.571 --> 00:20:49.621
I'll forget your criticism of the Association.

00:20:50.161 --> 00:20:51.701
Thank you for your time.

00:20:52.201 --> 00:20:54.081
I welcome you to the team.

00:20:54.751 --> 00:20:55.871
We expect great things from you…

00:20:57.041 --> 00:20:57.961
Genos.

00:21:10.811 --> 00:21:11.471
Master…

00:21:15.561 --> 00:21:17.481
I will be back later.

00:21:19.191 --> 00:21:20.821
Oh, okay.

00:21:21.361 --> 00:21:22.481
See you later, then.

00:21:22.861 --> 00:21:25.151
Yes, farewell.

00:21:53.011 --> 00:21:54.981
A waste of time?

00:21:56.891 --> 00:21:59.061
Such an interesting fellow.

00:22:03.691 --> 00:22:09.951
Hey, come back home soon

00:22:03.691 --> 00:22:09.951
nee hayaku kaette kite ne

00:22:17.251 --> 00:22:23.171
When my worries keep me awake under the crescent moon

00:22:17.251 --> 00:22:23.171
tameiki ga mikazuki wo yurasu yoru wa

00:22:23.171 --> 00:22:29.301
All I can do is close my eyes and think of you

00:22:23.171 --> 00:22:29.301
me wo tojite kimi no koto kangaete bakari

00:22:29.301 --> 00:22:32.351
I want to see you, I feel like crying

00:22:29.301 --> 00:22:32.351
aitai kibun nakitai kibun

00:22:32.351 --> 00:22:34.851
I feel so romantic

00:22:32.351 --> 00:22:34.851
romantikku na kibun

00:22:34.851 --> 00:22:41.401
I hope my feelings reach you

00:22:34.851 --> 00:22:41.401
todokete kono omoi

00:22:41.861 --> 00:22:50.161
I know so very well

00:22:41.861 --> 00:22:50.161
datte zutto shitteiru no

00:22:50.161 --> 00:22:55.371
how hard you always work

00:22:50.161 --> 00:22:55.371
ganbatteru koto takusan

00:22:57.081 --> 00:23:00.041
You're the one I love

00:22:57.081 --> 00:23:00.041
daisuki na hito ga

00:23:00.041 --> 00:23:03.171
You're so strong, yet still I worry

00:23:00.041 --> 00:23:03.171
tsuyokute shinpai

00:23:03.171 --> 00:23:09.131
Only I ever see your weakness

00:23:03.171 --> 00:23:09.131
watashi ni dake wa yowasa misete

00:23:09.131 --> 00:23:15.181
I'll find you before the stars

00:23:09.131 --> 00:23:15.181
hoshi yori saki ni mitsukete ageru

00:23:15.181 --> 00:23:21.021
Come right back home

00:23:15.181 --> 00:23:21.021
massugu kaette kite ne

00:23:21.021 --> 00:23:29.241
Hey, come back home soon

00:23:21.021 --> 00:23:29.241
nee hayaku kaette kite ne

00:23:33.741 --> 00:23:34.451
So…

00:23:35.491 --> 00:23:37.411
When you said you'd be back…

00:23:37.411 --> 00:23:38.751
This is what you meant?

00:23:39.371 --> 00:23:40.001
Yes.

00:23:40.501 --> 00:23:42.751
I went home to gather my things.

00:23:44.631 --> 00:23:46.251
May I stay here?

00:23:46.751 --> 00:23:48.461
Absolutely not.

00:23:49.841 --> 00:23:51.221
I have rent money.

00:23:55.641 --> 00:23:57.641
Did you bring a toothbrush?

00:23:57.641 --> 00:23:58.351
Yes!

00:24:00.021 --> 00:24:20.041
NEXT
TIME

00:24:00.021 --> 00:24:20.041
THE
TERRIFYING
CITY

00:24:00.851 --> 00:24:03.731
I am Class A rank 38, Snek!

00:24:03.731 --> 00:24:06.901
A lot of guys think my name is "Snake,"

00:24:06.901 --> 00:24:08.571
but it's Snek, so don't forget it!

00:24:08.571 --> 00:24:10.281
Next time, on One Punch Man : Episode 6,

00:24:10.281 --> 00:24:11.821
"The Terrifying City."

00:24:11.821 --> 00:24:15.201
There's time left?
Well, I'm fully aware of that.

00:24:15.201 --> 00:24:16.741
That's right! In this industry,

00:24:16.741 --> 00:24:20.041
it's common to kill time with episode previews!
